# Project invariants (daily-magic)

## Code clarity and types

- Prefer self-documenting structure and names. Comments justify non-obvious decisions (“why”), not mechanics the code already expresses.
- Do not use the `any` type. Prefer explicit types, generics, or `unknown` with safe narrowing.
- Prefer `const` over `let`.

## Layout

- Routes and API handlers live under `src/app/`.
- Feature modules live under `src/features/`.
- Shared UI lives under `src/components/` (TailAdmin vendored components).
- Framework utilities live under `src/lib/`.

## Commits

- Husky enforces message format — see **`.cursor/harness/git-hooks.md`**.
- Always stage and commit `.feature-knowledge/index.json` when it changed.
- Do not bypass git hooks unless a human explicitly requests it.

## Verification (when to run, not how)

- **Cursor agent hooks** (`.cursor/hooks.json`) run architecture + structure checks after writes and on agent stop — see **`rules-agent-hooks.mdc`**.
- Scripts and routing: **`npm run harness:bootstrap -- --workflow=verify`** (manifest: **`.cursor/harness/agent-bootstrap.manifest.json`**).
- After substantive code changes: attach **`@.cursor/commands/command-verify-post-change-lint-typecheck-tests.md`** when routing matches.
- Before commit: **`npm run harness:bootstrap -- --workflow=commit`** or Husky (see **`npm run harness:sync`** output).

## Styling

This repo uses **Tailwind CSS 4**, not SCSS modules or `enrg-frontend-styleguide`.

## Hosting and trackers

- **GitHub** for git remote, issues, and pull requests.
- **Linear** (or similar) for issue keys in branch names when useful.
- No Bitbucket, Jira CLI scripts, or Sentry harness automation in this repository.

## Scaffolding

Prefer **`pnpm scaffold`** (see **`.agents/scaffold/README.md`**) for new components, hooks, utilities, and tests instead of empty hand-written files.
